  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Development Fund (CDF)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fondo de Desarrollo Comunitario</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE OF THE CDF IS TO IMPROVE LIVING CONDITIONS, ECONOMIC OPPORTUNITIES AND SOCIAL WELL-BEING OF THE POOREST COMMUNITIES IN SURINAME. THE PROGRAM WILL CONSIST OF TWO COMPONENTS:(I) SMALL COMMUNITY-BASED BASIC SOCIAL AND ECONOMIC INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECTS; AND (II) TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE AND INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING FOR THE CDF AND BENEFICIARY COMMUNITIES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
